 * Check that `from` is a proper prefix of `path` (a strict ancestor).
 *
 * @param {string[]} from candidate ancestor tokens
 * @param {string[]} path candidate descendant tokens
 * @returns {boolean} whether `from` is a proper prefix of `path`
 */
